WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.875
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:05.625
and their managers live together under one roof

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:07.583
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:09.791
and start getting real

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:10.666
This is

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:11.583
The Champions

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:20.000
Nice suit

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Are you Marcelo’s new tax attorney?

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:24.500
I am speaking at charity event tonight

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:25.625
And you’re wearing this?

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.083
Uh..da?

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:28.041
OK hold on

00:00:28.041 --> 00:00:29.000
I need to make a call

00:00:33.791 --> 00:00:35.541
So today we’re going to be helping

00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:37.625
one of the greatest playmakers in the game

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:38.750
Luka Modric

00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:40.708
I love Luka

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:42.708
Luka is one of the most entertaining

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.625
creative footballers on the pitch

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:45.791
but off the pitch

00:00:45.791 --> 00:00:47.291
he could use a little bit of help

00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:49.250
And that’s where we come in

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.541
Hey, there he is!

00:00:50.541 --> 00:00:52.375
Luka, what’s good, my man?

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.000
Hello

00:00:54.041 --> 00:00:56.416
I understand you have to give a big talk

00:00:56.416 --> 00:00:57.916
at the charity dinner tonight

00:00:57.916 --> 00:00:59.916
Charity events are a great opportunity to

00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:01.875
build your brand and to get great press

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:03.583
Luka’s gotta take advantage of that

00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:05.291
and we’re here to show him how

00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:09.333
Ugh. What is this shirt?

00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:10.083
Checkers?

00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:11.083
Ugh, gross

00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:13.041
OK, you just offended all of Croatia

00:01:13.041 --> 00:01:14.125
Ooh!

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:14.958
Haha

00:01:14.958 --> 00:01:15.916
Wassap!

00:01:18.416 --> 00:01:19.875
Er, please take that off

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:22.375
Luka’s style of dress should reflect his style of play

00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:24.833
Sharp, creative, unpredictable!

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.541
Er, I don’t know about this

00:01:33.541 --> 00:01:34.958
I know what your problem is

00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:36.416
You need a neck tattoo

00:01:36.416 --> 00:01:37.291
Come here!

00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:38.666
OK

00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:40.291
show me your celebration

00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:42.666
OK

00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:43.708
Uh

00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:44.833
Yea!

00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:47.666
Just after a goal is the best time to take the focus

00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:49.708
away from your team and on to you

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:51.625
But without a signature celebration

00:01:51.625 --> 00:01:53.000
it’s like, why even score?

00:02:02.791 --> 00:02:05.333
Now that Luka’s got his on-the-field celebration down

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:07.708
I need to show him how to celebrate OFF the field

00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:10.791
Yo man

00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:12.333
who are are these bobos?

00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:13.750
That’s my wife and my kids

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:15.083
Luka’s a family man

00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:16.208
and I respect that

00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:18.291
I just want to expand his family to include

00:02:18.291 --> 00:02:21.208
a few influencer models and maybe an American rapper

00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:23.625
Luka, I want you to meet Tyga

00:02:23.625 --> 00:02:24.666
Sup fam

00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:25.875
Uh...hello

00:02:26.166 --> 00:02:28.541
I don’t know who this weird ass Owen Wilson-looking dude is

00:02:28.541 --> 00:02:30.666
but they’re paying me 10 grand a day so f--k it

00:02:31.708 --> 00:02:33.166
So Luka’s got great hair

00:02:33.166 --> 00:02:35.083
but he can do so much more with it

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.791
Now THAT’s a Galactico

00:02:48.791 --> 00:02:50.625
Wow, you may not be a striker

00:02:50.625 --> 00:02:51.833
but you look STRIKING

00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:53.625
Oh, you’re going to kill it tonight

00:02:55.958 --> 00:02:57.125
So remember

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.291
if I can go from refugee to Galactico

00:03:00.291 --> 00:03:01.625
so can you!

00:03:05.416 --> 00:03:06.958
So you guys have any questions?

00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:08.291
Yes, you?

00:03:08.583 --> 00:03:11.000
What is Sergio Ramos like?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:11.583
Uh

00:03:11.583 --> 00:03:14.291
What was it like playing with Ronaldo?

00:03:14.291 --> 00:03:15.083
Um

00:03:15.083 --> 00:03:16.666
Do you know Messi?

00:03:16.666 --> 00:03:17.500
What?

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.500
Do you know Lionel Messi?

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:20.666
Uh

00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:22.125
Oh no, he’s dying up there

00:03:22.125 --> 00:03:22.666
What is this?

00:03:22.666 --> 00:03:23.916
They still don’t care about him

00:03:23.916 --> 00:03:24.541
Uh oh

00:03:24.541 --> 00:03:26.666
I think we need to bring in the big guns

00:03:30.541 --> 00:03:31.250
It’s-a me

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:31.875
Mario!

00:03:31.875 --> 00:03:33.458
B-B-B-Balotelli!

00:03:35.375 --> 00:03:37.250
Everyone gets a firework!

